<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT NEW ZEALAND BY FOUR WICKETS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT NEW ZEALAND BY FOUR WICKETS.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat New Zealand by four wickets in the Singer Champions Trophy cricket tournament on Wednesday.</p>
<p>New Zealand 192 all out in 50 overs; Pakistan 196-6 in 48.3 overs.</p>
</text>
